# Matrix Online

_hoi chummers! Enjoy a new smooth Matrix. No Crash necessary this time. Matrix Devices that can be bricked, Technomancer Sprites, Hosts and IC - everything you need to prevent your fellow players the job to get pizzas while you deck things out with GOD._ 

Apart from a bunch of minor improvements, it adds the following major features that interact with eachother for fun and fast Matrix vtt play.

- **Sprites**, read more about them [here](https://www.patreon.com/DeepResonanceWare/posts/sprites-159855580)
- **Matrix Devices**, read more about them [here](https://www.patreon.com/DeepResonanceWare/posts/sneak-prev-160452368)
- **PAN's**, read more about them [here](https://www.patreon.com/DeepResonanceWare/posts/sneak-prev-area-162293857)
- **HOSTS & IC**, read more about them [here](https://www.patreon.com/DeepResonanceWare/posts/sneak-preview-ic-164815112)

AND! We now have FoundryVTT v14 compatibility. In one of the next feature releases (4.x), I will drop FoundryVTT v13 support. For more descriptive information, screenshots and movieclips about this release than the release notes below, check out the (free) Patreon Blog post.

-yeroon  

